# TODO: Translation updated at 2025-12-28 16:20

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:7
translate chinese ch2ep1_49ad9c58:

    # lev "Most people give the books or the couch a once-over. But you... you went straight for the busted clock."
    lev "大多数人都会看看书或者沙发。可你……却直奔那个坏掉的钟。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:8
translate chinese ch2ep1_510de199:

    # mc "Just wanted to see if it still ticks."
    mc "只是想看看它还走不走了。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:9
translate chinese ch2ep1_4c75d638:

    # lev "Some folks take it apart to figure out how it works. Others... they're scared of what might happen if it ever starts ticking again."
    lev "有人会把钟表拆开，琢磨怎么修好。其他人……则会害怕钟重新走起来之后可能发生的事。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:19
translate chinese ch2ep1_2db44991:

    # mc "Lately... it feels like my head's a TV stuck between channels."
    mc "最近……我觉得我的脑子就像一台不停换台的电视。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:20
translate chinese ch2ep1_628d38ae:

    # mc "I'm going through the motions, but it's all just static. Nothing clicks. Nothing fits."
    mc "我会有各种各样的情绪，但全都是雪花。白噪音。感觉一切都不对劲。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:21
translate chinese ch2ep1_b0b039bd:

    # lev "Static is {i}still{/i} a signal. Means something's in there—still trying to break through."
    lev "噪音也依旧是一种信号。这代表那里并非空无一物——依然有什么东西想要破茧而出。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:31
translate chinese ch2ep1_2236f57a:

    # lev "Okay. No need to dig. We'll just circle the hole a bit. Glance in every now and then. No shovels."
    lev "没事。不必深究。我们旁敲侧击一下。回想一下过去的点滴。不用想太深。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:34
translate chinese ch2ep1_dfd660fe:

    # yt "I'd... rather not."
    yt "还是……免了。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:37
translate chinese ch2ep1_5356300d:

    # yt "Some things... are better off..."
    yt "有些事情……最好……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:40
translate chinese ch2ep1_ccdf23b0:

    # yt "... staying buried..."
    yt "……永远被埋葬……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:46
translate chinese ch2ep1_b3f3a1a0:

    # mc "This... This room again..."
    mc "又是……这个房间……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:83
translate chinese ch2ep1_e4fdc436:

    # un "{size=-10}[mc]."
    un "{size=-10}[mc!t]。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:84
translate chinese ch2ep1_4469ef9e:

    # lev "[mc]."
    lev "[mc!t]。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:93
translate chinese ch2ep1_6208c506:

    # lev "You with me?"
    lev "能听到吗？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:96
translate chinese ch2ep1_2b35b6fe:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:97
translate chinese ch2ep1_1d2fbfea:

    # lev "You alright there, [mc]?"
    lev "你没事吧，[mc!t]？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:195
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_d93480ce:

    # lev "[mc]? We're not done yet."
    lev "[mc!t]？还没结束呢。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:196
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_d085d704:

    # mc "Sorry, I need to head home."
    mc "对不起，我得回家了。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:245
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_91ffd8d2:

    # mc "Yo. Where's your van?"
    mc "哟。你车呢？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:246
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_ad4afdeb:

    # shu "It's... not here."
    shu "车……不在这。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:247
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_fbd1074e:

    # mc "Yeah, I figured that out on my own. Thought I'd ask before calling the cops."
    mc "那确实，我也看出来了。我就想着报警之前先问问你。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:248
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_fa9494a4:

    # shu "Relax, man. It's in the shop."
    shu "冷静，哥们。车在店里呢。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:252
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_5722d729:

    # mc "Since when do you put your van in a shop? You usually duct tape it until it stops wheezing."
    mc "什么时候开始你还会把车送店里了？一般不都是把坏的地方用胶带贴一下嘛。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:253
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_95985dd4:

    # shu "Yeah, well... this time she gave out for real. Figured I'd let the pros take a swing."
    shu "这个嘛……这次车是真的不行了。所以我想着让专业的人看看。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:254
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_37fcb8ba:

    # mc "Did you sell it?"
    mc "你给卖了？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:257
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_456f4f3a:

    # shu "What? Pfff, no! I love that van. It's got history. Memories. Smells."
    shu "什么？怎么可能！那辆车是我的心头肉啊。全都是历史。记忆。还有气味。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:258
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_3a82bc3c:

    # mc "Exactly why I thought you finally snapped and sold it for scrap."
    mc "所以我才觉得你终于忍不下去，把它卖给收废铁的了。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:262
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_f224d47f:

    # shu "Don't insult her like that. She's not junk—she's... vintage."
    shu "不准你这么侮辱她。她可不是废铁——顶多算是……古董车。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:263
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_c8a19d0c:

    # mc "Vintage usually runs. Yours just... sat there like a retired war vet on life support."
    mc "古董车一般还能跑。你那辆……只会像当了救生员的退伍老兵一样一动不动。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:264
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_bfb4b7a4:

    # shu "She's getting her spine realigned, okay? Suspension work. Maybe a paint job."
    shu "她正大修呢，好吧？给悬挂好好整整。说不定再重新喷个漆。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:267
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_26da21dd:

    # mc "A paint job? Since when do you care about how she looks?"
    mc "喷漆？你啥时候开始在乎车的外观了？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:268
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_308033c3:

    # shu "Since I figured that if she's gonna die on the road, she might as well go out looking sharp."
    shu "从我觉得既然她要报废在半路上，那干脆好好打扮一下再上路的时候开始。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:269
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_6a323500:

    # mc "So you sold her?"
    mc "所以还是给卖了？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:270
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_43b16a82:

    # shu "Yeah, I sold her. Gonna get myself a new ride, baby. Something that doesn't sound like a dying goat when it turns left."
    shu "是啊，卖了。得买辆新车呢，哥们。至少买辆左转的时候不会叫得跟快死的山羊一样的车。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:274
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_6225666a:

    # mc "*exhales*"
    mc "*叹气*"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:275
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_5cc37865:

    # mc "Alright, spill. What the hell's been going on with you this past year?"
    mc "行了，老实交代。这一年你都干嘛去了？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:276
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_8740a210:

    # shu "What do you mean? We've always been around each other, haven't we?"
    shu "什么意思？我们俩不是一直在一块吗？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:277
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_74d51e85:

    # shu "Like Bonnie and Clyde, with all the police chases and deadly shootouts. You screaming like a damsel in distress and me always there to save the day."
    shu "就跟邦妮和克莱德似的，天天不是被警察追就是枪林弹雨。你一直乱叫，活脱脱一个落难公主，而哥们儿我永远是你随叫随到的超级英雄。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:278
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_62d36f7e:

    # mc "Clearly the exhaust from that old beater has gotten to your brain."
    mc "显然那辆破车喷出来的废气已经熏坏你的脑子了。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:279
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_03106a01:

    # shu "Yet another reason why I cashed out on her while I still could. In any case, why do you ask?"
    shu "所以我更得抓住机会赶紧给她卖了。你问这些干嘛？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:282
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_46d922e4:

    # mc "This one's for the folks clicking through our lives like it's some kind of visual novel. You know... the ones dying to know where you disappeared to."
    mc "主要是为了那些一直点点点，把我们的生活当视觉小说一样看的人问的。你知道吧……就是那群超想知道你跑到哪去了的人。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:283
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_1ec295ff:

    # shu "... Right. Them."
    shu "……哦，他们啊。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:286
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_ccd149e5:

    # shu "Okay, picture this..."
    shu "OK，想象一下这种画面……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:291
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_b392e38d:

    # shu "High noon. Middle of nowhere, sun hotter than sin, and I'm in a standoff with some cowboy who looks like he chews barbed wire for breakfast."
    shu "正午时分，四周都是荒野，太阳毒得快要把人晒死，而我正跟一个牛仔对峙，那人一看就是个把铁丝网当早餐嚼的狠人。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:292
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_b4aada48:

    # mc "*chuckles* Of course you are."
    mc "*笑* 可太真了。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:295
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_49e24614:

    # shu "I'm holding the line. There's a girl behind me, shaking like a leaf, yet there's not a scratch on her."
    shu "我一动不动。有个女孩躲在我身后，止不住地发抖，可她浑身上下没有受一点伤。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:296
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_7fe617f3:

    # shu "The guy I'm facing? He's got a six-shooter and an ego the size of Quinara."
    shu "而我要解决的人呢？他手里拿着一把六发左轮，还觉得自己是整个奎纳拉最牛逼的人。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:301
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_02a7e242:

    # mc "What'd you have?"
    mc "你手里有什么家伙？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:304
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_1d791ffa:

    # shu "..."
    shu "……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:307
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_123d1a56:

    # shu "A wrench."
    shu "一把扳手。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:308
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_b94a8806:

    # mc "A wrench?"
    mc "扳手？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:311
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_4d4281a5:

    # shu "Yup. Still made him miss. Dodged the shot, swung the wrench, clocked him so hard he whirlybirded like a fidget spinner."
    shu "是啊。最后他还是没打着我。我躲过了子弹，扳手一挥，他被我抽得跟陀螺一样转。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:312
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_1ca026c5:

    # mc "... That's not how physics works."
    mc "……这可违反物理定律了啊。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:315
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_02c387c7:

    # shu "Whatever, man..."
    shu "别打岔，兄弟……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:318
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_5d17a9fa:

    # shu "Anyway, her whole crew came crawling out of hiding after that. Found out I saved a whole caravan of runaway girls."
    shu "总之，那个女生躲着的伙伴们紧接着就都跑出来了。原来我是救下了一群离家出走的女生。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:319
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_e9f5232b:

    # shu "They called me their {i}\"guardian angel\"{/i} or some crap like that."
    shu "她们还说我是他们的“守护天使”之类的。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:320
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_fda94aff:

    # mc "Let me guess, you rode off into the sunset?"
    mc "我猜猜啊，最后的画面是不是你骑马消失在夕阳之中？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:323
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_b46e1c4c:

    # shu "Nah. Sunset rode off into me."
    shu "不。是夕阳骑马消失在我之中。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:327
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_238035ea:

    # ju "I better not be part of whatever delusional bullshit that conversation was."
    ju "我诚挚地希望我跟你俩刚刚说的那些狗屁没有丝毫联系。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:334
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_37183f62:

    # mc "Was she there?"
    mc "她也被你救了？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:335
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_b0e0f2ce:

    # shu "She, in fact, was."
    shu "的确如此。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:341
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_0930042f:

    # shu "But enough about my escapades..."
    shu "不过我的过去也说得够多了……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:342
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_b699ef04:

    # shu "What about you?"
    shu "你呢？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:345
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_c38bdf69:

    # mc "Well? I'm now the regional manager of Best Burger. Started running a charity. Also a member of Sicae Agency. And Klara's depressed."
    mc "我吗？我现在是最强汉堡的区域经理了。开始运营慈善组织。又成了西卡的成员。克拉拉还抑郁了。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:347
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_27801b75:

    # shu "GREAT!"
    shu "太棒了！"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:348
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_422b0eb6:

    # mc "But you already knew that. This whole conversation's stupid."
    mc "不过这些你都知道了。我们的对话根本没有价值啊。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:349
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_13db9f16:

    # shu "Then hit me with something I don't know."
    shu "那就说点我不知道的。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:352
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_e76cb277:

    # mc "I've been dreaming."
    mc "我一直在做梦。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:353
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_39853187:

    # shu "About what?"
    shu "什么梦？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:354
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_55e19287:

    # mc "I'm just in this room. All white. Just... nothing."
    mc "我在一个房间里。到处都是白色。其他的……什么都没有。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:355
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_6d777b15:

    # shu "That's awesome!"
    shu "那多好！"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:358
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_d585453c:

    # mc "That's your takeaway?"
    mc "你觉得很好？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:359
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_3fb09b05:

    # shu "Yup. Sounds peaceful. Or like purgatory. Or IKEA."
    shu "对啊。感觉那里很平静。或者像是炼狱。或者是宜家。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:360
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_e9f4af49:

    # mc "There's no furniture."
    mc "那里面没有家具。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:361
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_2d6f9935:

    # shu "Definitely IKEA."
    shu "那更像宜家了。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:364
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_2b35b6fe:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:365
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_6d4113a6:

    # mc "Anyone home?"
    mc "有人在家吗？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:366
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_c6fb0592:

    # shu "... Not that I know of. Well, aside from {i}someone{/i}."
    shu "……据我所知，没有。嗯，除了{i}那个人{/i}。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:370
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_7365b439:

    # mc "You eaten yet?"
    mc "你吃饭没？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:371
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_eb163792:

    # shu "Nope, not yet. You cooking for me?"
    shu "没呢。你要给我做吗？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:379
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_b04cca67:

    # mc "Solid performance."
    mc "表现不赖。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:380
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_3a9ea7d3:

    # mc "Alright, let's head in."
    mc "行，进去吧。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:390
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_45a007eb:

    # mc "You gonna be alright on your own?"
    mc "你自己一个人可以吗？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:391
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_7f641208:

    # shu "Yeah, yeah, don't sweat it. I'm good."
    shu "嗯，没问题。不用担心。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:392
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_0f1a49cb:

    # shu "Gotta wrap my head around this so-called \"state-of-the-art\" business management stuff anyway."
    shu "反正我得尽力研究这个所谓的“最先进”的商业运营相关的东西嘛。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:393
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_6a05e28e:

    # mc "Alright then. Knock yourself out."
    mc "好吧。那你加油。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:397
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_208699f0:

    # kmother "{sc}{font=Beowolf.ttf}Your sister never stumbled like this. At least she made something of herself."
    kmother "{sc}{font=tl/chinese/font/XiangCuiLingDuHei.ttf}你姐姐从来没有这样失误过。至少她闯出了一点名堂。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:398
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_5fda44d5:

    # kfather "{sc}{font=Beowolf.ttf}Leaving the clan?"
    kfather "{sc}{font=tl/chinese/font/XiangCuiLingDuHei.ttf}你居然想离开氏族？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:399
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_57ac5912:

    # kfather "{sc}{font=Beowolf.ttf}After everything we carved into you, you're just spitting it back in our faces?"
    kfather "{sc}{font=tl/chinese/font/XiangCuiLingDuHei.ttf}我们教了你那么多，你就是这样回报我们的？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:408
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_bb50ab15:

    # k "{i}Some rooms swallow sound like it's something sacred."
    k "{i}有些房间会吸收声音，仿佛那些响动是什么神圣之物。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:409
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_96d5d773:

    # k "{i}You step through the door, and the air forgets how to breathe."
    k "{i}你一踏进门，就连呼吸的方法都会忘掉。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:412
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_34f50437:

    # k "{i}The coffee cools in the same untouched spot."
    k "{i}凉透的咖啡依然纹丝不动地放在相同的位置。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:415
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_a521dc0e:

    # k "{i}The window blinks at the same tired hour."
    k "{i}窗户也令人厌烦地在同一个时刻眨眼。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:418
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_5f1257e9:

    # k "{i}Dust moves around like it's minding its manners."
    k "{i}就连灰尘的移动，也好似遵循着它该遵守的礼节。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:421
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_9402f247:

    # k "{i}I count things, sometimes. Seconds, moments that don't ask for much."
    k "{i}有时，我会数数。数流过的秒钟，以及那些不经意的瞬间。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:422
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_6ad1773f:

    # k "{i}The silence between footsteps."
    k "{i}数脚步声间隙的沉寂。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:423
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_aa608bb7:

    # k "{i}The hush between thoughts that try too hard to matter."
    k "{i}数尽全力想显得很重要的那些念头之间的缄默。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:426
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_48846535:

    # k "{i}I'm not stuck. I just never chose which way to fall."
    k "{i}我没有停滞。我只是还没有选好该如何倒下。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:427
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_64bd731f:

    # k "{i}And falling... falling's a commitment."
    k "{i}而倒下……倒下也是一种孤注一掷。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:428
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_f20e7bcd:

    # k "{i}So I stay. In the quiet. In the in-between."
    k "{i}所以我停在这里。在寂静之中。在中间地带。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:429
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_b0d62df0:

    # k "{i}Where memories are insignificant."
    k "{i}这里的记忆，都无足轻重。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:430
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_faca1bd5:

    # k "{i}Where the floor doesn't creak unless I let it."
    k "{i}这里的地板，若非我所愿便不会吱呀作响。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:431
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_287f6c37:

    # k "{i}Where nothing ever grows loud enough to wake me."
    k "{i}这里的一切，都无法响亮到唤醒我。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:432
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_9834a904:

    # k "{i}And that passes for peace."
    k "{i}这就是算是安宁了。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:438
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_58d251b7:

    # k "{i}*exhales*"
    k "{i}*叹气*"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:439
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_2986c6cb:

    # k "{i}... Or maybe I'm only redecorating the cage."
    k "{i}……又或许，我只是在重新装饰这座囚笼。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:442
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_3e6f788e:

    # k "{i}Every day, I catch myself waiting—hoping—for someone to play that piano again."
    k "{i}每天，我都发现我自己等待着——希望着——有人能再次奏响那架钢琴。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:443
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_98232e24:

    # k "{i}God... I miss the sound of it..."
    k "{i}天啊……我太想念它的声音了……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:457
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_aae7426f:

    # k "{i}But it's never music that finds me. It's footsteps. Steam. An aroma that doesn't belong to dust and decay."
    k "{i}可是我期待的从来不是音乐。而是脚步声。是气息。是与尘埃和腐败毫无关联的味道。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:458
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_2af445d9:

    # k "{i}I know that smell like an old promise..."
    k "{i}那味道与旧日的承诺何其相似……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:459
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_41770c48:

    # k "{i}A boy—no, a man—who says my name without flinching."
    k "{i}一个男孩——不，男人——能够毫无顾虑地说出我的名字。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:460
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_14a74115:

    # k "{i}It's almost cruel, the way his warmth walks in like it owns the place."
    k "{i}他的温暖，好似是掌控这里的主宰一般，就这么走进来。多么残忍。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:461
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_bf48cbd3:

    # k "{i}Cruel... and curiously kind."
    k "{i}残忍……却又有一种令人神往的和蔼。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:470
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_92c0ed9f:

    # k "{i}Day three-hundred eighty-three of keeping myself locked away in this room."
    k "{i}把自己锁在这个房间里，已经有三百八十三天了。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:471
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_e8d7d58f:

    # mc "Has that clock always been busted?"
    mc "那个表是不是一直都是坏的啊？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:472
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_71e5068d:

    # k "It's been dead since the day we moved in."
    k "我们搬进来那天就是坏的。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:473
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_4929dc42:

    # k "I even swapped the battery once... still nothing."
    k "我还换过一次电池……依旧没用。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:474
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_751ec012:

    # mc "Huh... that's weird, 'cause I just—"
    mc "呃……奇怪，我明明——"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:475
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_2b1456e4:

    # k "Hm?"
    k "嗯？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:478
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_52858e8e:

    # mc "Never mind, doesn't matter."
    mc "没事，没什么。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:479
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_d38d6e85:

    # k "{i}Breakfast, lunch, even dinner, he leaves everyone else behind and comes here."
    k "{i}早餐，午饭，甚至晚饭，他总是不管其他人，来到这里。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:480
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_09c2d5a1:

    # k "{i}Same time, every day. Like it's wired into him... or some kind of routine."
    k "{i}每天都在同样的时间造访。好像已经成了他的日常……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:484
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_204fbe7e:

    # mc "Want me to take a look at it?"
    mc "要不我修一下？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:485
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_83da2b97:

    # k "No, it's fine. The ticking just makes my ears ring anyway."
    k "不用，没关系。反正滴答声只会让我心烦。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:486
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_21a56f6e:

    # mc "You need some sunshine, Klara."
    mc "你需要晒晒太阳，克拉拉。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:487
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_9b82a6ef:

    # k "{i}He's always been calling me by name, but lately... his tone's a bit different..."
    k "{i}他一直都会直呼我的名字，可最近……他的语气变了……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:488
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_c9a5bc2a:

    # k "{i}A sign he's growing up? Or maybe... just growing tired of me?"
    k "{i}是因为他已经长大成人了吗？又或者说……他已经厌倦我了？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:489
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_201b73d2:

    # k "I mean... the sun does reach my window, so technically..."
    k "阳光……又不是照不到我的窗户，所以严格来说……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:490
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_5d6e3931:

    # mc "I meant {i}outside{/i}, lady."
    mc "我是说{b}到外面{/b}，女士。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:491
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_82516781:

    # k "Just pulling your leg."
    k "我开个玩笑。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:495
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_6510e083:

    # k "Thanks, [mc]."
    k "谢谢，[mc!t]。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:496
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_f14cef8d:

    # mc "Day—I already lost count—of trying to get you to step outside."
    mc "都数不清这是连着第几天想让你出门了。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:497
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_8e94b70f:

    # k "Three-hundred eighty-three."
    k "三百八十三。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:498
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_d6673f8e:

    # mc "*chuckles* So you've been keeping score. Not bad."
    mc "*笑* 原来你一直数着啊。不赖。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:501
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_e7e9a1a3:

    # k "{i}He grabs his own plate..."
    k "{i}他拿起了他自己的盘子……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:505
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_eed1287b:

    # k "{i}... sits down across from me."
    k "{i}……坐在我对面。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:509
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_2b35b6fe_1:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:510
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_01323761:

    # k "{i}... and says nothing."
    k "{i}……然后一句话也不说。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:516
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_17497d46:

    # k "{i}I know I've disappointed him... but he's never once raised his voice."
    k "{i}我知道我让他失望了……可他从来没有发过脾气。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:535
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_355f8bab:

    # k "Dont. Ever. Say that name again..."
    k "永远。不准。再说那个名字……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:536
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_5a96c474:

    # a "I'm sorry, I didn't mean to—"
    a "对不起，我不是故意——"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:557
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_956ea041:

    # mc "Still not a fan of being on camera, huh?"
    mc "还是不喜欢被拍吗？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:558
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_33fbcd0d:

    # k "You know why. That hasn't changed."
    k "你知道为什么。那一点从来没变过。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:562
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_f61db65e:

    # k "{i}He gets up, takes my plate like always, and—"
    k "{i}他站起身，跟往常一样拿起我的盘子，然后——"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:565
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_cabdeb99:

    # mc "Anyway, I should get going."
    mc "总之，我该走了。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:566
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_41807252:

    # k "Got somewhere to be?"
    k "要去哪里？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:569
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_2b35b6fe_2:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:570
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_3a2fa644:

    # k "... Right. I forgot."
    k "……对啊。我忘了。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:573
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_089e1d09:

    # mc "Do you even know what day it is?"
    mc "你还能搞清楚今天是星期几吗？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:574
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_418b2501:

    # k "Monday."
    k "星期一。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:575
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_4029af80:

    # mc "It's Thursday."
    mc "已经星期四了。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:578
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_802d36e5:

    # k "If you've got things to do, you shouldn't waste your lunch breaks on me, [mc]."
    k "你要是有事要做，就别把午休时间浪费在我身上了，[mc!t]。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:581
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_c9164f70:

    # mc "I'm not here for the food, Klara."
    mc "我不是来这里吃饭的，克拉拉。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:584
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_fa705f3a:

    # k "!"
    k "！"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:589
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_8998e1d7:

    # k "{i}Didn't see that last part coming...{/i}"
    k "{i}刚刚这句话倒是没有预料到……{/i}"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:601
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_ed2c9c5f:

    # shu "How's she? How's the therapy going?"
    shu "她怎么样了？有疗效吗？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:602
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_cf108701:

    # mc "What therapy?"
    mc "什么疗效？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:603
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_a46e89df:

    # shu "Oh, whatever..."
    shu "啊，好吧……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:606
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_63700380:

    # shu "Right! You invited everyone to your birthday yet? It's creeping up, man!"
    shu "对了！你邀请大伙给你过生日了吗？没剩几天了！"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:608
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_c3285ade:

    # mc "... There are a few I haven't reached out to. Doubt they'll say yes either way."
    mc "……有几个人还没联系。虽然我估计他们反正也不会同意的。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:609
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_3b0b493c:

    # mc "Still... I'll give it another shot."
    mc "不过呢……我还是会再试试。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:610
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_e416af4b:

    # shu "Drama?"
    shu "闹矛盾了？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:611
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_118333b7:

    # mc "Drama."
    mc "闹矛盾了。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:614
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_1fb87b62:

    # shu "Hey, not trying to poke around your personal baggage, but..."
    shu "我也不是想打探你的隐私，不过……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:615
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_4bd1d0b3:

    # shu "The show must go on, right?"
    shu "戏总得继续演下去，对吧？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:616
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_f7c7e2f3:

    # mc "*chuckles* Yeah. The show must go on."
    mc "*笑* 是啊。戏总得继续演下去。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:618
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_8091f4da:

    # mc "There are a few I haven't talked to yet."
    mc "还有几个人没通知到。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:621
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_a478564e:

    # shu "You can leave those. I'll handle the rest once I'm done here."
    shu "盘子就不用管了。我吃完之后会解决的。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:622
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_30387bf3:

    # mc "One broken glass, one broken bone."
    mc "打碎一个，我就打断你一根骨头。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:623
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_1f1344ad:

    # shu "What do you take me for? I'm not some pampered prince."
    shu "你把我当什么人？我又不是被宠坏的王子。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:624
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_ff5e69d2:

    # mc "Nah, you're worse."
    mc "你比那还糟糕。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:628
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_9b813656:

    # shu "Anyway, there are a couple chicks outside."
    shu "行了行了，外面还有两个妹子等着你呢。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:629
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_1ef706f6:

    # mc "Who?"
    mc "谁？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:630
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_f9cd3829:

    # shu "Your wife and... someone I don't recognize."
    shu "你老婆，还有……一个我不认识的人。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:639
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_053cc467:

    # ao "Hm... Looks better than the roof we used to have back in the military... Good for you..."
    ao "嗯……看着比我们以前在军队里住的地方好多了……算是好事……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:640
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_ee368bb2:

    # m "Can you not bring the military up every time?"
    m "你就一定每句话都要提军队吗？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:647
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_e59c3082:

    # ao "I'll remember the address... just in case... Thanks for showing me around..."
    ao "我会记住这里的地址……以防万一……谢谢你给我带路……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:648
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_044c1ada:

    # m "Do you even plan on coming back?"
    m "你真的还打算回来吗？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:649
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_e5831b67:

    # ao "That's not something I can answer... not even for myself..."
    ao "这个问题……我自己也不知道答案……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:650
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_4dff8b46:

    # m "Did you..."
    m "你是不是……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:651
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_de02fb93:

    # m "Why? She gave you a way out."
    m "为什么？她明明给你提供了出路。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:654
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_04f45ec6:

    # ao "We're all chained to something, Moon..."
    ao "我们都被什么东西给束缚着，月……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:655
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_0d0ee77c:

    # ao "Without this... I'd just spend every waking second thinking of new ways to kill myself..."
    ao "如果挣脱的话……我就只会想该怎么死去而已……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:656
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_0c2a11ad:

    # ao "So I'm staying with them... To atone. For good..."
    ao "所以我会留在他们那边……作为弥补。永不离开……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:657
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_c66741f7:

    # m "You're starting to sound like another Claire."
    m "你这话说的，活脱脱是第二个克莱尔。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:661
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_ec4a183b:

    # ao "Maybe that's just how it is for people like us... We survive, sure... But always in a cage..."
    ao "或许对我们这种人来说，就只有那一种结局……我们虽能活下来……但余生只能和笼子相伴……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:664
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_2df3d041:

    # ao "The only difference is... you got to live on the other side of it..."
    ao "唯一的区别是……你能活在笼子外面……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:665
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_e612037c:

    # m "..."
    m "……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:668
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_daca9f31:

    # mc "Aoife."
    mc "艾法。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:671
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_f619196e:

    # ao "What is it..."
    ao "怎么了……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:674
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_a58f76be:

    # ao "... Tsukigami Kaito...?"
    ao "……月神海人……？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:675
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_fb52978e:

    # mc "That's not my name."
    mc "我不叫那个名字。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:676
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_e9288233:

    # ao "[mc] it is, then..."
    ao "好吧，那就[mc!t]……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:688
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_28ab5fa0:

    # ao "What's that for...?"
    ao "这是……？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:689
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_e44ddcf2:

    # mc "Never got the chance to thank you."
    mc "一直没能找到机会谢谢你。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:700
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_cf7efaa5:

    # mc "You! You told them where I—"
    mc "你！就是你告诉了他们我在哪——"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:701
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_689f26e6:

    # ao "Save it... I wasn't their scout, and I didn't rat you out... I got the intel from them, not the other way around..."
    ao "省省吧……我不是他们的探子，也没有出卖你……恰好相反，是我从他们那里得到了情报……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:704
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_823fcd18:

    # mc "So you can speak."
    mc "原来你会说话啊。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:705
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_d00bc9b1:

    # ao "And with that... I'll probably lie to someone else tomorrow..."
    ao "我明天……可能又要去骗人了……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:706
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_d251c79d:

    # mc "Let me out."
    mc "放我走。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:709
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_af869c1a:

    # ao "I can't... And I don't have much time for this..."
    ao "不行……而且我的时间也不多了……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:712
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_8f64befb:

    # ao "Tell me, are you really Number Three...?"
    ao "告诉我，你真的是三号吗……？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:713
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_9361873e:

    # mc "Apparently, yeah. That's me. Or so some crazy people call me."
    mc "是啊，没错。就是我。至少有些疯子是那么叫我的。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:716
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_6b4f3558:

    # ao "I don't see a thing from you..."
    ao "我根本看不出来……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:717
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_439d5e70:

    # ao "My eyes have been cursed to see the darkness in people..."
    ao "我的眼睛受到诅咒，能看到人身上的黑暗……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:718
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_052f6c88:

    # ao "Every lie..."
    ao "每个谎言……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:719
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_48400bad:

    # ao "Every fracture in their soul..."
    ao "灵魂中的每个缺陷……都清清楚楚……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:720
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_e71ff562:

    # ao "But you... There's nothing..."
    ao "可你身上……什么也没有……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:721
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_0fb2f7ff:

    # ao "No darkness... Just... an empty expanse of white..."
    ao "没有黑暗……只有……无边无际的白色……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:722
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_b7f7559b:

    # mc "That's..."
    mc "这……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:725
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_c37a1ce7:

    # ao "So someone's told you that too..."
    ao "看来已经有人告诉过你了……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:726
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_1feed62c:

    # mc "What the hell is that even supposed to mean?"
    mc "到底是什么意思啊？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:729
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_a297c717:

    # ao "I don't know... I've never met anyone like you..."
    ao "我不知道……我从来没见过你这样的人……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:730
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_b4c1c912:

    # ao "Maybe one day, you'll figure it out... and let me know..."
    ao "或许有一天，你会弄清楚一切……然后再告诉我……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:733
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_02180e0f:

    # ao "Here... Eat..."
    ao "给……吃吧……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:734
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_5a30985c:

    # mc "What's in it?"
    mc "里面是什么？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:735
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_c0e3b664:

    # ao "Just ham, egg... and bread... Or do you want something fancy?"
    ao "只是火腿，鸡蛋……还有面包……你想吃更高级的吗？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:736
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_2b35b6fe_3:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:739
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_a5c00dc2:

    # ao "If it's poisoned, you should probably thank me for sparing you the slow death..."
    ao "要是里面下了毒，你反而该感谢我没有让你痛苦又缓慢地死去……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:740
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_2b35b6fe_4:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:743
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_37acb13d:

    # ao "Eat... And make it quick..."
    ao "吃吧……快点……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:751
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_c7eee6ff:

    # ao "I'll see you on the other side..."
    ao "我们在那边再见吧……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:752
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_8b5e620a:

    # mc "Wait!"
    mc "等等！"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:755
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_f619196e_1:

    # ao "What is it..."
    ao "怎么了……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:758
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_5dcfb991:

    # ao "... Subject Number Three...?"
    ao "……三号实验体……？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:759
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_6294a051:

    # mc "Tsk. Don't call me that."
    mc "啧。别那么叫我。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:762
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_462f70cf:

    # ao "*laughs* Oh, would you look at that? You and her both have that satisfying little tongue click... I love it..."
    ao "*大笑* 瞧啊，你和她，连那悦耳的咂嘴声都一样……我很喜欢……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:765
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_2b35b6fe_5:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:766
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_278e3b1c:

    # ao "Alright, fine... What is it...?"
    ao "好吧，好吧……怎么了……？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:769
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_cc88a3a7:

    # mc "You're with them them, right? So why help me?"
    mc "你不是跟他们一伙的吗？为什么帮我？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:770
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_500b759f:

    # ao "Call it... curiosity..."
    ao "可以说是……好奇心吧……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:771
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_9675f1b5:

    # mc "Seriously? Word is you've been offing your own friends without blinking. Mercy doesn't really suit you."
    mc "真的吗？我听说你杀掉以前的朋友的时候连眼都不会眨一下。慈悲之心实在不适合你。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:774
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_3864a381:

    # ao "..."
    ao "……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:777
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_5bd00465:

    # ao "\"Mercy\" is what I gave them... A release from the misery they could never escape..."
    ao "我给她们的，正是“慈悲”……让她们能不再被无法逃脱的苦难折磨……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:778
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_aa684fdc:

    # mc "You're not some god. You don't get to make that call."
    mc "你又不是神。你没资格做那种事。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:781
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_65a8a451:

    # ao "Maybe not... but someone has to play god..."
    ao "或许吧……但总要有人扮演神的角色……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:782
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_0b1ccc9f:

    # ao "*scoffs* If anything... you don't have a shred of ground to judge me... You've never felt a serum chewing through you like termites in the beams..."
    ao "*嗤笑* 要我说……你也没资格评判我……你从来没有体会过被血清腐化的感觉……那种，如同白蚁啃食房梁一般的感觉……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:783
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_d3b031c8:

    # mc "Then... is she alive? You went after her, didn't you?"
    mc "那……她还活着吗？你不是去找她了吗？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:786
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_3864a381_1:

    # ao "..."
    ao "……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:787
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_8d68d817:

    # ao "She was always said to be the strongest among us..."
    ao "总有人说，她是我们之中最强的……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:788
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_d81ebdcd:

    # ao "Terrible with guns, so she made up for it with blades..."
    ao "枪法很差，所以用刀刃弥补……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:789
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_177aa1bd:

    # ao "And even then, she became a monster on the field..."
    ao "尽管如此，她还是成了战场上的怪物……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:790
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_0e6c3809:

    # ao "Dozens of missions, same story every time. She came back, the others didn't."
    ao "出了几十次任务，但结果都一样。永远只有她一个人活着回来。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:791
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_8cbc695e:

    # ao "... That became the foundation of what she is now."
    ao "……这也造就了现在的她。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:792
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_ee50af5f:

    # ao "A Sovereign..."
    ao "她成了君王……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:793
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_de85d92a:

    # ao "Probably the most dangerous one we've ever recorded..."
    ao "或许是我们遇见过最危险的一个……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:794
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_6fb05d81:

    # mc "A... what? That's not what I asked."
    mc "她成了……什么？我不是问你这些。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:795
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_7858c73a:

    # ao "She's likely on her way here, right now..."
    ao "她现在大概正在赶来这里的路上……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:796
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_5f5f4f4b:

    # ao "And when she gets here... I'll be the one to end her suffering... once and for all..."
    ao "等她到了之后……就由我……永远终结她的痛苦……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:797
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_663eb9bb:

    # ao "And maybe... mine too..."
    ao "说不定……还能连着我的痛苦一起……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:801
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_3864a381_2:

    # ao "..."
    ao "……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:808
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_d2f2df22:

    # mc "Maybe one day, I'll be able to tell you what it means."
    mc "或许有一天，我真能告诉你那到底代表着什么。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:809
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_9e4b5150:

    # ao "I'll save you a glass of whiskey..."
    ao "我会给你留一杯威士忌的……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:830
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_f59aa597:

    # m "Private property. Hands off."
    m "私人财产。不准碰。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:831
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_3864a381_3:

    # ao "..."
    ao "……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:835
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_1a7b6985:

    # ao "*shakes her head* Grow up, Mom..."
    ao "*摇头* 成熟点吧，妈妈……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:841
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_89d29ebf:

    # mc "Mom?"
    mc "妈妈？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:842
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_e66e93e6:

    # ao "What, you didn't know? She's the one who named me. Technically makes her my mother..."
    ao "怎么，你不知道吗？是她给我起的名字。所以理论上说她就是我妈妈了……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:845
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_c85591e5:

    # ao "Catch you two on the flip side..."
    ao "下次见，二位……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:856
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_a31340dd:

    # mc "Really?"
    mc "真的啊？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:857
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_e612037c_1:

    # m "..."
    m "……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:858
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_5ce2a0de:

    # mc "I'll take that as a yes."
    mc "看来你这是默认了……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:861
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_4d0fc244:

    # mc "Where's the trip to, though? I overheard a bit of your conversation—it sounded serious."
    mc "不过，你们去哪了？我听到了一些你们的对话——感觉很严肃。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:862
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_150413ba:

    # m "Jess offered her freedom after working with them for a while..."
    m "在给婕斯他们干过一段时间活之后，他们同意放艾法自由了……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:863
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_2c1f28f9:

    # m "But she chose to stay on and became a roaming asset like what I used to do. Taking whatever jobs they throw her way."
    m "但她选择留下，当组织的自由人，就跟我以前一样。承办一切交给她的任务。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:864
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_c9ec9194:

    # m "Undercover work, intel gathering, sabotage, assassination... whatever's on the table."
    m "潜入卧底，情报收集，渗透破坏，暗中刺杀……什么都做。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:867
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_f1ae646b:

    # mc "... Aren't we working for the government now?"
    mc "……我们现在不是给政府干活了吗？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:868
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_4c0a83bd:

    # m "Yeah. So?"
    m "是啊。所以呢？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:869
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_577d0132:

    # mc "*scoffs* Right... Got it."
    mc "*嗤笑* 也对……明白了。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:878
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_582359ea:

    # mc "Hm?"
    mc "嗯？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:884
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_7ff44459:

    # m "I'm home."
    m "我回来了。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:887
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_82dec9db:

    # mc "Just the sweetest little angel you are. Welcome home."
    mc "真是最可爱的小天使。欢迎回来。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:891
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_049d5391:

    # mc "Welcome back."
    mc "欢迎回来。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:894
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_7365b439_1:

    # mc "You eaten yet?"
    mc "你吃饭了吗？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:895
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_1f8beb9e:

    # m "Mhm, yeah. Grabbed lunch with Aine and Emma."
    m "嗯，吃了。跟艾妮和艾玛一起吃的午饭。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:898
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_59945f8e:

    # mc "You've been doing pretty well without me lately. Should I be impressed... or worried?"
    mc "你最近离了我，也过得很好啊。我是该开心……还是担心？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:899
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_2995ba07:

    # m "You were the one who told me to get used to it."
    m "是你让我习惯那样子的。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:900
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_c61c5602:

    # mc "I told you to stay calm whenever we're apart. Never said you had to get used to it. I'm not going anywhere."
    mc "我是让你跟我不在一起的时候也保持冷静。没有说你得习惯才行。我可不会离开你。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:901
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_57917505:

    # m "And that's exactly what I've been doing. I've been managing the time apart... and lately, it hasn't been so bad."
    m "我就是在照做啊。我一直在努力撑过分开的时间……最近，也没有那么难受了。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:902
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_5c315e6f:

    # mc "That's good. You may be my secretary, but I never wanted you to depend on me like I'm your whole world, alright?"
    mc "很好。虽然你是我的秘书，但我不希望你的世界里只有我一个人，好吗？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:903
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_41075280:

    # m "That's the ninety-seventh time you've said that since I became your aide."
    m "自从我成了你的助手以来，这话你已经说了九十七遍了。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:904
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_167d7565:

    # mc "Starting to sound like a broken record, huh?"
    mc "开始听烦了吧？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:907
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_f765a8e3:

    # m "No. I love the attention."
    m "没有。我喜欢你在乎我的样子。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:908
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_6746c6eb:

    # mc "*chuckles* Of course, you do."
    mc "*笑* 那当然会喜欢。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:911
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_dbda06a8:

    # m "By the way, are you planning to head back to the office?"
    m "对了，你要回办公室吗？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:912
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_59b4db31:

    # mc "Yeah, why?"
    mc "是啊，怎么了？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:913
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_a64ada61:

    # m "Don't bother. I already finished signing off whatever paperwork you had left for today."
    m "不用回了。我已经把你今天要做的文书工作全做完了。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:914
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_57b8c3d9:

    # mc "You're a lifesaver. In more ways than one."
    mc "你真是我的救命恩人。以各种方式救我的命啊！"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:915
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_0bb06f69:

    # m "Aine and Emma are there too, just in case I missed anything."
    m "艾妮和艾玛也在那里，所以也不用怕我遗漏了什么。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:916
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_3c5f07d8:

    # mc "Aine's one thing... but Emma?"
    mc "艾妮在就算了……艾玛也在？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:917
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_9606dbfb:

    # m "Mhm. I heard they're planning to hit the firing range together."
    m "嗯。我听说她们要一起去靶场。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:918
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_b18de2c9:

    # mc "Oh... They've really been into that lately. Why don't you join them?"
    mc "噢……她们最近很喜欢打枪啊。你怎么不跟她们一起呢？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:921
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_4ed52c9e:

    # m "Mmmmm..."
    m "嗯嗯……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:923
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_efeeac6f:

    # mc "Then maybe we can swing by the local dojo next time. How about that?"
    mc "或者我们之后可以一起去道场？怎么样？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:926
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_f05f6305:

    # m "I'd love that~!"
    m "好啊好啊~！我要去！"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:927
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_73162d78:

    # mc "... Alright, easy with the sparkly eyes. You don't have to melt my heart just to get a sparring match."
    mc "……好啦，眼睛里的爱心都要跳出来了。比试一下而已，不用融化我的心也会答应你的。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:930
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_d761d037:

    # mc "Let's see who's better, then."
    mc "那就看看我俩谁更强。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:931
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_20ac7032:

    # m "Really? Who's better?"
    m "真的吗？要比谁更强？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:932
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_c17824c3:

    # mc "Pretty sure it'll count as practice for me."
    mc "肯定能让我好好练习一下。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:936
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_82f66fec:

    # mc "Real blades."
    mc "用真家伙。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:940
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_30568743:

    # mc "... I shouldn't have challenged you, should I?"
    mc "……我是不是不该对你下战书啊？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:943
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_ba52bc59:

    # m "No, no~! No backing out now. A husband's got to keep his promises to his wife."
    m "不行不行~！现在不准反悔。老公答应老婆的事一定要做到的。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:946
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_3c578d08:

    # mc "Well, I'm actually kinda pumped about this. We've never had the chance to spar before."
    mc "其实我还挺兴奋的。我们之前从来没比试过。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:947
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_784eefdc:

    # m "Yeah... One year barely felt like enough time for everyone to even breathe, let alone settle down."
    m "是啊……一年时间感觉哪怕喘口气都不够用，更别说彻底安顿下来了。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:950
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_cabdeb99_1:

    # mc "Anyway, I should get going."
    mc "总之，我该走了。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:951
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_0567cf18:

    # m "Oh, you've still got plans? I thought—"
    m "噢，你还有事要忙吗？我以为——"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:952
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_a4ad4a86:

    # mc "Nah, nothing work-related. Birthday's coming up, so I've got people to invite. And I promised I'd pick Freya up from the burger shack later."
    mc "没有，不是工作上的事。我要过生日了，所以要去邀请人来。而且我也答应芙蕾雅待会要去汉堡店接她。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:955
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_887a6299:

    # m "Got it. Stay safe out there."
    m "好的。路上小心。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:959
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_617fd032:

    # mc "*chuckles* Guess I really got her fired up about the dojo thing..."
    mc "*笑* 看来提到去道场真的让她很开心……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:961
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_88f60a26:

    # mc "Right... you're more of a blade girl."
    mc "对了……你更喜欢用刀。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:964
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_cabdeb99_2:

    # mc "Anyway, I should get going."
    mc "总之，我该走了。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:965
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_0567cf18_1:

    # m "Oh, you've still got plans? I thought—"
    m "噢，你还有事要忙吗？我以为——"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:966
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_a4ad4a86_1:

    # mc "Nah, nothing work-related. Birthday's coming up, so I've got people to invite. And I promised I'd pick Freya up from the burger shack later."
    mc "没有，不是工作上的事。我要过生日了，所以要去邀请人来。而且我也答应芙蕾雅待会要去汉堡店接她。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:969
translate chinese ch2ep1cont2_887a6299_1:

    # m "Got it. Stay safe out there."
    m "好的。路上小心。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:988
translate chinese aoifepause_b99c2ec8:

    # shu "Anyway, a chick just arrived."
    shu "行了行了，外面还有个妹子等着你呢。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:989
translate chinese aoifepause_1ef706f6:

    # mc "Who?"
    mc "谁？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:990
translate chinese aoifepause_3aae0180:

    # shu "Your wife."
    shu "你老婆。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:1001
translate chinese aoifepause_307fbdc5:

