translate chinese freyacarblowjob_36dd1f15:

    # yt "But then Klara broke... and all that preparation, all our bottled-up courage just crumbled with her."
    yt "可之后克拉拉就崩溃了……所有那些准备，以及我们匆忙拼凑出来的勇气也都随之烟消云散。"

