translate chinese freyacarblowjob_e53b1ce8:

    # yt "Still gripping the truth like it's a live grenade, praying that maybe staying quite will sting less than honesty."
    yt "真相依然像个随时会爆炸的手雷一样躺在我们手里，我们只能祈祷或许保持沉默会比实话实说带来的伤害更少。"

