translate chinese skypause3_8ab44ada:

    # k "Want a story?"
    k "要听故事吗？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2289
translate chinese skypause3_24eec0dd:

    # mc "Now?"
    mc "现在？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2297
translate chinese skypause3_91adf21f:

    # k "Why not? It's dinner time. Seems appropriate."
    k "不可以吗？晚饭时间，很合适。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2301
translate chinese skypause3_8553afbb:

    # k "There was a woman who lived in a room that forgot itself."
    k "有个女人，住在一个被遗忘的房间里。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2302
translate chinese skypause3_3fa4fff9:

    # k "Once, it carried voices, shelves bending under books, windows that breathed with the weather."
    k "曾经，房间也热闹过，书架被书本压弯，窗户随着天气一同呼吸。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2303
translate chinese skypause3_dabe0fc4:

    # k "But someone left. And the walls went still, like they didn't trust sound anymore."
    k "但有人走了。之后，墙壁陷入沉寂，好似已不再信任声音一般。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2304
translate chinese skypause3_c90558a4:

    # k "She shut the door to hold onto what little stayed."
    k "女人为了守住还剩下的东西，关上了门。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2305
translate chinese skypause3_eea950e4:

    # k "Eventually, she stopped lighting candles. Said the glow made the quiet lean in too close."
    k "后来，她连蜡烛也不点了。说是那光芒会让寂静靠得太近。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2308
translate chinese skypause3_068659e2:

    # k "The windows crusted over. She told herself the sun would pry too much out of her if she let it in."
    k "窗户上也布满了灰尘。她告诉自己，要是让阳光进来，便会窥探走太多她的秘密。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2309
translate chinese skypause3_bca3fc51:

    # k "So no one knocked. And she never touched the latch."
    k "于是，无人敲门。她也再没触碰过门闩。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2310
translate chinese skypause3_a56e43be:

    # k "The room sank into waiting, not sure what it was anymore."
    k "房间没入等待之中，却连在等什么都已忘却。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2313
translate chinese skypause3_cc5b2f6c:

    # k "Then one night, someone walked in. No knock. No fanfare."
    k "有一天晚上，有人进来了。没有敲门。没有发出任何声响。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2314
translate chinese skypause3_b7a0cc0a:

    # k "They sat down. Said nothing. Lit a candle."
    k "那人坐了下来。没有说话。只点燃一根蜡烛。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2315
translate chinese skypause3_b389167f:

    # k "Not out of hope. Not out of love, either. Just for that sliver of presence."
    k "并非出于希望。也并非出于爱意。仅仅是为了那些微的存在。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2316
translate chinese skypause3_f041c9df:

    # k "And the room shifted, like it remembered how to hold a heartbeat again."
    k "然后房间就变了，好像它又回想起如何容纳心跳。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2319
translate chinese skypause3_8f323e22:

    # mc "... Huh?"
    mc "……嗯？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2320
translate chinese skypause3_6b2bff30:

    # k "Nothing. Just air I needed to get out."
    k "没什么。只是说些憋在心里的话。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2346
translate chinese skypause3_78a91349:

    # mc "So... did the person stay?"
    mc "那……那个人留下了没？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2347
translate chinese skypause3_395291df:

    # k "... What?"
    k "……什么？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2348
translate chinese skypause3_9a05e1e9:

    # mc "In your story. The one who lit the candle. Did they stay?"
    mc "你的故事里，点亮蜡烛的那个人。那个人留下了吗？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2360
translate chinese skypause3_cfb0c0c5:

    # k "Maybe. Depends what they were looking for."
    k "可能吧。取决于那人在寻找什么。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2361
translate chinese skypause3_9347c9d6:

    # mc "And what was that?"
    mc "在寻找什么？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2364
translate chinese skypause3_c194cecc:

    # k "Some people hear quiet and think it's peace. Others hear the same quiet and call it dark."
    k "有人听到一片寂静，觉得这是安宁。有人听到同样的寂静，却称之为黑暗。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2365
translate chinese skypause3_0dd94179:

    # mc "*chuckles* Some don't mind either way."
    mc "*笑* 有人觉得二者都可以。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2366
translate chinese skypause3_d8e6f0ac:

    # k "Some can't even tell which is which."
    k "而有人根本分不清哪个是哪个。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2383
translate chinese skypause3_59d7c123:

    # k "... You're about to baptize your shirt in sauce."
    k "……酱要弄到衣服上了。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2385
translate chinese skypause3_65dc5dab:

    # mc "Ah, shit—" with hpunch
    mc "啊，操——" with hpunch

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2388
translate chinese skypause3_d3048fc8:

    # k "{i}The room doesn't stay alive for long. But sometimes, a moment's enough to trick it into breathing again."
    k "{i}房间并没有恢复生机太久。但有时候，一小会儿就足够让它重新呼吸起来了。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2401
translate chinese skypause3_51895d03:

    # mc "Anyone seen Emma?"
    mc "有人看见艾玛了吗？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2402
translate chinese skypause3_f07d7b76:

    # m "She left a few hours ago."
    m "她几个小时前就走了。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2403
translate chinese skypause3_f3d5ebe6:

    # mc "Did she eat before she took off?"
    mc "她走之前有没有吃东西？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2404
translate chinese skypause3_3ae46081:

    # s "Hmm... don't think so."
    s "嗯……没吃吧。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2405
translate chinese skypause3_3cea7349:

    # mc "*exhales* Damn..."
    mc "*叹气* 唉……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2408
translate chinese skypause3_b79b35ef:

    # k "{i}Day three-hundred eighty-four.{/i}"
    k "{i}第三百八十四天。{/i}"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2421
translate chinese skypause3_f08ec43c:

    # k "{i}Just a little light...{/i}"
    k "{i}有一点点光……也好……{/i}"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2424
translate chinese skypause3_82091822:

    # k "..."
    k "……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2436
translate chinese skypause3_82091822_1:

    # k "..."
    k "……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2446
translate chinese skypause3_31b87ce8:

    # mc "... You lit it?"
    mc "……你点的？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2454
translate chinese skypause3_86611cf8:

    # k "... It was getting dim."
    k "……快灭了。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2460
translate chinese skypause3_e04fec8a:

    # mc "*shrugs* Looks good from here."
    mc "*耸肩* 我看倒还好。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2477
translate chinese skypause3_a85a1a7c:

    # k "[mc], do you..."
    k "[mc!t]，你……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2480
translate chinese skypause3_f49fff8f:

    # mc "Yeah?"
    mc "怎么了？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2481
translate chinese skypause3_73258766:

    # k "... No, it's... nothing."
    k "……没事，没什么。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2484
translate chinese skypause3_2b35b6fe:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2514
translate chinese skypause3_69919d83:

    # mc "Bite-size."
    mc "小矮子。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2517
translate chinese skypause3_1dbec9e2:

    # ju "Protein Shake."
    ju "大傻个。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2518
translate chinese skypause3_77f86df6:

    # mc "*nods* Good one."
    mc "*点头* 这外号不错。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2522
translate chinese skypause3_d7734b81:

    # ju "*groans* Jackass..."
    ju "*叹气* 混蛋……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2535
translate chinese skypause3_8b4bfa79:

    # mc "Did my watch stop, or are you actually early?"
    mc "是我的表停了，还是你的确来早了？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2536
translate chinese skypause3_5fbf73a5:

    # cl "I don't keep people hanging. Waste of time."
    cl "我不喜欢让人等着。浪费时间。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2539
translate chinese skypause3_64aeb788:

    # cl "You showed up sharp. Good. Half the people I deal with can't even button a jacket straight."
    cl "你按时来了。很好。跟我打交道的人里，有一半连系扣子都不会。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2542
translate chinese skypause3_ec08f730:

    # mc "So we're going somewhere?"
    mc "要去其他地方吗？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2545
translate chinese skypause3_9de3290b:

    # cl "Yeah. But not here. Too many shadows leaning in."
    cl "是啊。但别在这说。隔墙有耳。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2546
translate chinese skypause3_c5c09466:

    # mc "That bad?"
    mc "这么严重？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2547
translate chinese skypause3_851eb86e:

    # cl "Bad enough. Just follow. Questions later."
    cl "非常严重。跟我来就行。之后再问。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2548
translate chinese skypause3_4f934bce:

    # cl "My car's around the corner. Leave your truck. I'll get you back when we're done."
    cl "我的车拐个弯就到。不用开你的了。聊完之后我送你回来。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2549
translate chinese skypause3_5d2722cb:

    # mc "... Fine."
    mc "……好。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2559
translate chinese skypause3_eea4938e:

    # mc "Looks like a library... but what's the point of dragging me here?"
    mc "看着像个图书馆……为什么带我来这里？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2560
translate chinese skypause3_969dd006:

    # cl "Not a library. Think of it more as an archive."
    cl "不是图书馆。更像是个档案库。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2563
translate chinese skypause3_ddab58bf:

    # cl "Every serum user—records, scraps, fragments of their lives. All kept here. So the traces don't vanish."
    cl "每个注射过血清的人留下的所有信息，都保存在这里。这样能确保记录不会消失。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2564
translate chinese skypause3_7586438e:

    # cl "This has been my work for years."
    cl "这里是我多年来的心血。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2565
translate chinese skypause3_a8ca1d53:

    # mc "... That's... a mountain's worth of obsession."
    mc "……你……执念真够深的。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2568
translate chinese skypause3_f1edcc99:

    # mc "But if their names had to be kept here, I'm guessing most of them didn't walk away clean."
    mc "但要是他们的名字必须留在这里，我猜大多数人最后都没落得好下场吧。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2569
translate chinese skypause3_4b98cd30:

    # cl "Not most. No."
    cl "是的，大多数都没有。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2572
translate chinese skypause3_c9774265:

    # mc "So some did? Survive, I mean. Other than us?"
    mc "也就是也有人……？我指的是，活下来。除了我们之外，还有人？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2573
translate chinese skypause3_e4643a45:

    # cl "A handful. The ones the serum didn't break. Enough to count on fingers, if you're generous."
    cl "有几个。都是没有被血清摧毁的人。往大了说，还能用手指数数的。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2574
translate chinese skypause3_2e48cf33:

    # mc "Where are they now?"
    mc "他们现在在哪？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2575
translate chinese skypause3_fce46c81:

    # cl "Some under Jess' watch. A few tried to disappear into normal lives... not many managed it."
    cl "有些在被婕斯监视着。不少人想回归普通的生活……但没几个能做到。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2576
translate chinese skypause3_2061d0e2:

    # mc "Figures."
    mc "我就知道。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2579
translate chinese skypause3_2b35b6fe_1:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2580
translate chinese skypause3_24e0b85d:

    # cl "Someone caught your eye?"
    cl "有人吸引了你的注意吗？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2583
translate chinese skypause3_482443bb:

    # mc "Number Thirteen: Serene Rainyday..."
    mc "十三号实验体：赛琳·蕾尼蒂……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2584
translate chinese skypause3_02cb803e:

    # cl "Ah... her."
    cl "啊……原来是她。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2587
translate chinese skypause3_51c5f03b:

    # mc "Can I?"
    mc "可以吗？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2588
translate chinese skypause3_b105c9da:

    # cl "Go ahead. Careful with it. She wrote it herself—there's no copy."
    cl "请吧。小心点。这是她亲笔写的——没有副本。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2597
translate chinese skypause3_06762744:

    # ser "My name was Serene."
    ser "我的名字是赛琳。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2598
translate chinese skypause3_417c0be5:

    # ser "At least, that's what I remember. Before the Numbers. Before the cold black rooms."
    ser "至少，这是在血清和又冷又暗的屋子进入我的生活之前，我记得的那个名字。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2602
translate chinese skypause3_d5702ed4:

    # ser "I once lived by the sea with my older brother."
    ser "我曾经和我哥哥一起住在海边。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2603
translate chinese skypause3_4f61e3be:

    # ser "We crammed ourselves into a corroded flat that coughed with every storm."
    ser "我们一起挤在一间不断被一个又一个风暴摧残的小屋子里。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2604
translate chinese skypause3_e8a26bba:

    # ser "Pipes leaking, heater rattling, windows keening when the wind pressed too hard."
    ser "水管漏水，暖气片格格作响，风一大，窗户就开始哀嚎。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2607
translate chinese skypause3_17907e6a:

    # ser "Nothing ever worked the way it should, but we made it ours. The cracks carried our voices, and even the broken corners felt alive."
    ser "一切都破败不堪，但那是我们的家。裂缝里有我们的声音，就连残破的墙角似乎都有生命。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2608
translate chinese skypause3_20ea7f93:

    # ser "When silence locked me up, when I couldn't push out a word, he'd give me another one. A name. Something lighter than I felt."
    ser "每当沉默把我锁住，让我无法开口，他就会再给我一个名字。一个能让我内心轻松些的名字。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2612
translate chinese skypause3_8f5710d2:

    # ser "\"You're still my sunshine,\" he'd say, brushing the hair out of my eyes. \"Even when the clouds won't move.\""
    ser "“你仍旧是我的阳光”，他总会说着这种话，把我眼前的头发拨开。“哪怕云层不肯散去。”"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2613
translate chinese skypause3_90c71740:

    # ser "I never told him how much I clung to that. How much of my light only existed because he said it did."
    ser "我从来没跟他说过，那对我有多么重要。我的心里存在着光，完全是因为他曾经那么说过。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2617
translate chinese skypause3_91a33f2e:

    # ser "I was twelve when the men came. They said I was useful. That my blood carried something rare. Dangerous."
    ser "那些男人来的时候，我十二岁。他们说我会派上用场。说我的血里有一些既稀有又危险的东西。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2620
translate chinese skypause3_a468eb64:

    # ser "They handed my brother a paper. A choice dressed up as mercy. His signature bled onto the page while his eyes brimmed red."
    ser "他们递给我哥哥一张纸。给了他一个伪装成慈悲的选择。他红着眼，在纸上签了字。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2621
translate chinese skypause3_35fd3153:

    # ser "I told him it was okay. That I'd be back. That one day we'd laugh about it."
    ser "我告诉他，没关系的。我会回来，以后我们会对这事一笑了之。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2625
translate chinese skypause3_781e4e12:

    # ser "We never did."
    ser "我们再也没见过面。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2630
translate chinese skypause3_f18463b5:

    # ser "I was taken to a facility. They called it an institute, but it felt more like a terrarium. Glass walls, steel veins, and nowhere to hide."
    ser "我被带到一个设施里。他们叫那个地方“机构”，但那里感觉更像一个生态缸。玻璃墙，钢铁管线，以及无处躲藏。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2631
translate chinese skypause3_5e118ed4:

    # ser "They stripped me of my name and gave me a number: Thirteen. I asked if it meant bad luck. They didn't bother answering."
    ser "他们剥夺了我的名字，又给了我一个编号：十三号。我问，这是代表厄运的意思吗？他们理都没有理我。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2632
translate chinese skypause3_e18eb314:

    # ser "For the first year, I resisted, not with my fists, but by refusing their ideals. By failing their tests, ignoring their questions, turning my face from their needles until they pinned me down."
    ser "第一年，我一直在反抗。不是靠拳头，而是靠拒绝他们的意志。我故意让实验失败，无视他们的问题，躲开他们伸来的针头，直到他们把我死死按住。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2633
translate chinese skypause3_97098929:

    # ser "I was silenced with sedation more often than I was acknowledged as human."
    ser "我被注射镇静剂睡过去的时间，比我作为人活着的时间还长。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2636
translate chinese skypause3_a7f7957c:

    # ser "Then came the serum."
    ser "然后就是血清。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2637
translate chinese skypause3_62003e16:

    # ser "They called it progress. To me, it felt like trespass."
    ser "他们管这叫进展。对我来说，那更像是一种侵犯。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2638
translate chinese skypause3_4a521482:

    # ser "My body turned foreign. Dreams slipped away. Sleep stopped visiting often."
    ser "我的身体变得陌生。不会再做梦了。睡意也不常到来。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2639
translate chinese skypause3_6e1c5c26:

    # ser "Sight cut like blades. Sound clawed at me. Every sense tuned sharp enough to hurt."
    ser "眼中的景象像刀刃一样。声音也对我张牙舞爪。每个感官都敏锐到了痛苦的程度。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2640
translate chinese skypause3_9086dc15:

    # ser "They applauded my discipline. My adaptability. They said I was one of the proofs that their work had succeeded."
    ser "他们夸赞我的表现。说我很适应。说我是他们的工作成功的证据。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2641
translate chinese skypause3_ec0461c4:

    # ser "They called me a model subject. They said obedience was a virtue."
    ser "他们说我是模范实验体，还说服从是美德。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2642
translate chinese skypause3_c1278c64:

    # ser "But obedience is nothing. If there's a mercy, it would be erasure."
    ser "但服从不算什么。或许他们唯一的仁慈，就是对我的抹杀。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2646
translate chinese skypause3_568926d7:

    # ser "They shaped me into a weapon. Fed me languages I'll never use for mercy. Sent me on missions built to erase me. But somehow, I always came back."
    ser "他们把我变成了武器。教会我无比恶毒的语言。派我去执行专为除掉我的任务。但是，我每次总是能活着回来。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2649
translate chinese skypause3_89e6a520:

    # ser "I stopped asking why. Tools don't get to ask."
    ser "我不再问为什么。工具不会问问题。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2650
translate chinese skypause3_25e78467:

    # ser "But there was one thing they couldn't cauterize, not completely."
    ser "但有一件事，他们没办法完全抹掉。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2655
translate chinese skypause3_daaa6b92:

    # ser "Some nights, in the antiseptic dark, I still drifted back to the sea."
    ser "有些夜晚，在不见天日的黑暗中，我的思绪仍旧会飘回海边。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2658
translate chinese skypause3_950396f8:

    # ser "The wind shoving at cracked windows."
    ser "风敲打着有裂纹的窗户。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2661
translate chinese skypause3_5285affd:

    # ser "The smell of burnt rice clinging to the walls."
    ser "墙壁间萦绕着烧焦的米饭的味道。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2664
translate chinese skypause3_f1aa900c:

    # ser "My brother's arms around me, his voice giving me a name that meant light."
    ser "我哥哥抱着我，轻声给我起着象征着光明的名字。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2667
translate chinese skypause3_aa81f724:

    # ser "In those dreams, I walk into the ocean. Step after step..."
    ser "在那些梦中，我走向大海。一步又一步……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2670
translate chinese skypause3_12407547:

    # ser "... until everything dissolves. Until there's nothing left but hush."
    ser "……直到一切都溶解在水中。直到四周只剩缄默。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2674
translate chinese skypause3_6f65306f:

    # ser "And then I wake."
    ser "之后，我就会醒来。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2677
translate chinese skypause3_f25e3f91:

    # ser "But one time, waking was different. No cell. No handler. No orders waiting."
    ser "但有一次，醒来时的景象不太一样。没有牢房。没有束具。没有命令。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2678
translate chinese skypause3_6d440ad7:

    # ser "It was raining."
    ser "只有雨滴。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2681
translate chinese skypause3_41ddfadd:

    # ser "I lay there, listening to it knock across the roof. A sound I thought I'd lost."
    ser "我躺在那里，听着雨滴落在屋顶上的声音。我以为我永远不会再听到的声音。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2684
translate chinese skypause3_35bb0390:

    # ser "In a puddle on the floor, my reflection stared back—blurred, pale, almost erased. And yet behind it, I glimpsed the girl the world tried to smother."
    ser "在地板上的水洼里，我的倒影也看向我——模糊不清，面色惨白，几乎要被完全抹除掉。然而，在那倒影的角落，我却还瞥见了这个世界想要抹去的那个女孩。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2685
translate chinese skypause3_9688c9f1:

    # ser "Not who I was. Not who they built. But still... someone."
    ser "不是曾经的我。也不是他们打造出的人。但仍旧……是一个人。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2688
translate chinese skypause3_2da78174:

    # ser "So I chose a name. One that belonged to both pieces of me—the before, and the after."
    ser "所以我选了一个名字。一个既属于过去的我，也属于现在的我的名字。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2691
translate chinese skypause3_a99ad948:

    # ser "Serene Rainyday." with Dissolve(2.0)
    ser "赛琳·蕾尼蒂。（译注：原文为Serene Rainyday。Serene有宁静的意思，Rainyday意为雨天。）" with Dissolve(2.0)

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2692
translate chinese skypause3_d22e797c:

    # ser "Serene, because stillness is the only thing I still chase."
    ser "赛琳，是因为宁静是我唯一还在追求的东西。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2693
translate chinese skypause3_e89c84ac:

    # ser "Rainyday, because once, he called me light."
    ser "蕾尼蒂，是因为曾经，他说我是光芒。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2697
translate chinese skypause3_4465da8b:

    # ser "When I woke, the world was nothing different. And I was still standing in the battlefield."
    ser "我醒来的时候，世界毫无改变。我依然站在战场上。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2700
translate chinese skypause3_a541dc85:

    # ser "One day, if the world ever finds its stillness..."
    ser "如果有一天，世界找到了宁静……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2701
translate chinese skypause3_06aed7d1:

    # ser "When the wars are quiet, and the blood has dried..."
    ser "战争结束，不再流血……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2702
translate chinese skypause3_dbc4bebb:

    # ser "When no child is torn from the arms that love them..."
    ser "没有孩子再被从爱他们的人的臂弯中抢走……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2703
translate chinese skypause3_6dc2975e:

    # ser "And no voice is silenced in the name of power..."
    ser "也没有人的声音再被强权扼杀……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2707
translate chinese skypause3_8626d273:

    # ser "Let someone remember me."
    ser "希望有人能记住我。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2708
translate chinese skypause3_6f8ae827:

    # ser "Not as a weapon. Not as a Number."
    ser "不是作为武器。不是作为编号者。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2712
translate chinese skypause3_6e1d850a:

    # ser "But as a girl who once stepped into the rain, hoping to feel the sun again."
    ser "而是作为一个踏入雨中，想要再见到太阳的女孩。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2713
translate chinese skypause3_2502e9d4:

    # ser "— Serene Rainyday (Number Thirteen)"
    ser "——赛琳·蕾尼蒂（十三号）"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2717
translate chinese skypause3_9c9ceef8:

    # mc "Fuck... I don't think I can finish that."
    mc "操……我怎么可能读得下去。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2718
translate chinese skypause3_951150a8:

    # cl "Why not? You've barely read the first page."
    cl "怎么了？你连第一页都没看完呢。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2721
translate chinese skypause3_50fba413:

    # mc "Because I've got enough crawling around in my head already. I don't need to add hers to the pile."
    mc "因为我脑子里已经够乱了。不需要再连她的份一起。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2722
translate chinese skypause3_e76bc8c5:

    # cl "So now you're spiraling?"
    cl "你是要发疯了？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2723
translate chinese skypause3_03f2a978:

    # mc "... Not exactly. Not yet. Maybe."
    mc "……算不上。还没到那种程度吧，大概。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2724
translate chinese skypause3_098242a8:

    # cl "Can you please be clearer?"
    cl "能请你说清楚点吗？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2727
translate chinese skypause3_906f31f6:

    # mc "The way she wrote it... it feels too close. Some days I don't feel like myself at all. Like I'm wearing someone else's skin."
    mc "和她文字里描述的……非常像。有些日子里我觉得我根本不是我自己了。好像我只是披着别人的皮囊的怪物。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2728
translate chinese skypause3_99e24f20:

    # mc "And when I look in the mirror, it isn't even me staring back. It's warped. Like glass that won't stay still."
    mc "我看向镜子的时候，里面的人甚至不是我。而是扭曲的一团，好像玻璃在不断移动一样。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2729
translate chinese skypause3_d77bae23:

    # cl "Literal, or just a metaphor?"
    cl "那是真事，还是比喻？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2730
translate chinese skypause3_de316b8a:

    # mc "Literal."
    mc "真事。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2731
translate chinese skypause3_f6daacb2:

    # cl "Strange... I've never logged a case like that."
    cl "怪了……我从来没遇见过这种情况。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2732
translate chinese skypause3_162c97b1:

    # cl "Serene's kind of dissonance was common—people struggling to reconcile who they were with what the serum forced on them."
    cl "赛琳那种认知失调很普遍——在血清的影响下，实验体经常难以认知真实的自我。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2733
translate chinese skypause3_25fc2a65:

    # cl "But you..."
    cl "可是你……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2736
translate chinese skypause3_a82f69d5:

    # cl "... When did it start?"
    cl "……症状是什么时候开始的？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2737
translate chinese skypause3_3d1ea87b:

    # mc "A few weeks after... that incident."
    mc "是在那件事之后……几个星期。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2740
translate chinese skypause3_bb088b4a:

    # cl "So... could it be the serum itself mutating?"
    cl "嗯……会是血清在变异吗？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2741
translate chinese skypause3_aa18c1c5:

    # cl "... I should bring this to Jess, see if—"
    cl "……应该把这事告诉婕斯，看她——"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2744
translate chinese skypause3_83e35e47:

    # mc "No. Don't."
    mc "不。不要。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2745
translate chinese skypause3_86b70dca:

    # cl "Keeping her out could cost you."
    cl "不让她知道，你可能会吃苦头的。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2746
translate chinese skypause3_ebe3e694:

    # mc "If I wanted her in, I wouldn't be here with you."
    mc "如果我想告诉她，就不会来找你了。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2747
translate chinese skypause3_2362c08a:

    # cl "*sighs* This is exactly why I wanted your blood. You're the anomaly in all of us."
    cl "*叹气* 所以我才想要你的血。你是我们之中最异常的。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2748
translate chinese skypause3_faf38cab:

    # cl "I've been itching to test it, but Moon makes that... inconvenient."
    cl "我早就想化验一下了，可惜有月在……不方便。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2751
translate chinese skypause3_bb98c663:

    # cl "Purely for the data, of course."
    cl "当然，纯粹是为了研究。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2752
translate chinese skypause3_e33992df:

    # mc "Moon's not a problem. I can—"
    mc "不用担心月。我可以——"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2756
translate chinese skypause3_bb98e4ba:

    # cl "I know. I've got your permission, don't I?"
    cl "我知道。毕竟我有了你本人的允许，对吧？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2759
translate chinese skypause3_5e77c0c0:

    # cl "..."
    cl "……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2762
translate chinese skypause3_1f1d0487:

    # cl "You didn't even blink."
    cl "你连眼都没眨一下。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2763
translate chinese skypause3_a240de6d:

    # mc "It's you. I saw it coming. Though a needle would've been civilized."
    mc "我知道你的风格，预料到了。不过用注射器会更文明点。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2764
translate chinese skypause3_31d4a88f:

    # cl "Needles waste volume. I prefer raw. We heal fast enough anyway."
    cl "用那东西会浪费。我更喜欢新鲜的。反正我们的伤口愈合很快。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2767
translate chinese skypause3_5f6bbc65:

    # cl "... This should be enough."
    cl "……这么多应该足够了。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2768
translate chinese skypause3_32ed54df:

    # cl "No promises—I'm not Jess. But I'll see what I can extract."
    cl "我没法保证什么——我没婕斯那么厉害。但我会尽力而为。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2769
translate chinese skypause3_eaabbdfb:

    # mc "And if you do... it stays between us."
    mc "如果你发现了什么……不要让别人知道。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2773
translate chinese skypause3_424fa046:

    # cl "I'm good at keeping secrets. Don't worry."
    cl "我很会保守秘密。不用担心。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2774
translate chinese skypause3_67a8e77b:

    # mc "What kind of secrets?"
    mc "哪种秘密？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2775
translate chinese skypause3_25c54dab:

    # cl "The kind nobody benefits from dragging into the light."
    cl "见光之后没人有好处的那种。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2778
translate chinese skypause3_90c02c35:

    # cl "Perfect."
    cl "完美。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2779
translate chinese skypause3_0a852283:

    # mc "Even me?"
    mc "哪怕是我？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2782
translate chinese skypause3_1809da4c:

    # cl "{b}Especially{/b} you."
    cl "{b}特别{/b}是你。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2786
translate chinese skypause3_2b35b6fe_2:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2789
translate chinese skypause3_947a1af9:

    # mc "If everything you knew was about to collapse... what would you do?"
    mc "如果你所了解的一切都即将崩塌……你会怎么做？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2790
translate chinese skypause3_bedb8707:

    # cl "Ugh, really? I don't do philosophical soul-searching."
    cl "干嘛？我才不会搞什么哲学深思。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2791
translate chinese skypause3_ab513b2a:

    # mc "First thought, no filter."
    mc "说出第一想法就好。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2792
translate chinese skypause3_c1d59641:

    # cl "*sighs*"
    cl "*叹气*"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2795
translate chinese skypause3_0aa20c22:

    # cl "I'd stay put. No running."
    cl "我什么都不会做。不会逃走。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2796
translate chinese skypause3_a62f3200:

    # cl "Maybe... take someone's hand. Just to prove I wasn't going alone."
    cl "或许……会牵住某人的手。证明我不是一个人。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2797
translate chinese skypause3_ff97fb86:

    # cl "Because when things fall apart, it's not about fixing them. It's about leaving a mark that says you were there at all."
    cl "因为当一切都要崩塌的时候，就不可能再修复了。只有留下自己存在过的证明。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2800
translate chinese skypause3_28a53743:

    # mc "Not bad for someone who hates soul-searching."
    mc "虽然不爱哲学深思，但说的话不赖嘛。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2801
translate chinese skypause3_97a7af5b:

    # cl "Why, thank you."
    cl "那真是多谢了。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2804
translate chinese skypause3_691eed02:

    # mc "So... whose hand are you picturing?"
    mc "那……你想牵谁的手？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2805
translate chinese skypause3_9e9156e1:

    # cl "... Lance's."
    cl "……长矛的。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2806
translate chinese skypause3_2b35b6fe_3:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2807
translate chinese skypause3_5dd9d647:

    # mc "You two...?"
    mc "你们两个……？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2810
translate chinese skypause3_27b76a16:

    # cl "If you're angling for romance gossip, don't. I like him, that's all. That's enough for me."
    cl "别乱想什么桃花八卦了。我喜欢他，仅此而已。对我来说这就足够了。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2811
translate chinese skypause3_dc16ebcd:

    # mc "Got it."
    mc "明白。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2812
translate chinese skypause3_ad82fb96:

    # cl "Now go back to whatever corner you came from. I'll reach out if I find anything useful."
    cl "行了，你哪来的回哪去吧。如果我有了发现，会联系你。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2815
translate chinese skypause3_4d3e2ff3:

    # mc "Can I borrow her book?"
    mc "可以把她的书借给我吗？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2818
translate chinese skypause3_a265eabe:

    # cl "No."
    cl "不行。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2819
translate chinese skypause3_9464f4d5:

    # mc "Please. Just a couple of days."
    mc "求你了。几天时间就好。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2820
translate chinese skypause3_a32184eb:

    # cl "Bring it back tomorrow with the moon, the receipt tucked in, and every page breathing."
    cl "那你明天把书连着月亮和收据一起还回来，还要让书的每一页全都活过来。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2821
translate chinese skypause3_f8ad994a:

    # mc "... What?"
    mc "……什么？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2824
translate chinese skypause3_b50b8ce0:

    # cl "You can borrow anything else in here. Not this. Even you don't get to walk out with it."
    cl "别的东西你都可以借走。唯独这本书不行。哪怕是你也不能带出这个地方。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2825
translate chinese skypause3_8a559417:

    # yt "Strange. She never guards things this tightly. Best not to push."
    yt "奇怪。第一次见她这么珍视一件物品。还是妥协为好。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2826
translate chinese skypause3_cfadce6d:

    # mc "*sighs* Fine. I'll read it here."
    mc "*叹气* 好吧。我在这里读。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2841
translate chinese skypause3_5a76e02a:

    # mc "Why do you keep showing up? Who are you supposed to be?"
    mc "为什么你一直阴魂不散？你究竟是谁？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2844
translate chinese skypause3_47533fe1:

    # eee "Nothing fixed. Just a frame your head sketches in when it has nowhere else to put me."
    eee "我没有定型。只是你的脑子为了找个地方安置我，而随手画下的框线。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2845
translate chinese skypause3_7b2fd1ea:

    # mc "Then why you? Why this shape?"
    mc "那为什么会是你现在的样子？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2848
translate chinese skypause3_c5760bce:

    # eee "Because you gave it to me."
    eee "因为这模样是你给我的。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2849
translate chinese skypause3_6f7fe984:

    # mc "This dream... I don't even know what this place is..."
    mc "这个梦境……我根本不知道这地方究竟在哪……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2852
translate chinese skypause3_75669c58:

    # eee "Not a dream. Not quite."
    eee "这里算不上是梦境。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2853
translate chinese skypause3_3b42f136:

    # eee "Part of you keeps clawing its way {i}there{/i}—and when it slips, you fall here instead."
    eee "某一部分的你总想挣扎爬往{b}那里{/b}——而一旦失手，你就会跌落到这里。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2854
translate chinese skypause3_673d9b3e:

    # mc "There? Where?"
    mc "那里？那里是哪里？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2855
translate chinese skypause3_8ff471ea:

    # eee "Don't ask me. I don't store answers. I sift what you already buried."
    eee "不要问我。我没有答案。我只查看已被你埋葬的记忆。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2856
translate chinese skypause3_ab73935b:

    # eee "What you face, I face. What you turn away from, I can't reach."
    eee "你所面对的，即是我所面对的。而你转身回避的，我便无法企及。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2857
translate chinese skypause3_7562247c:

    # eee "This room is the boundary of your existence. A manifestation of where the tethers separating mind and body become slowly undone."
    eee "这个房间是你的存在的边界。预示着肉体和心灵之间的界限行将消散。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2860
translate chinese skypause3_95573fa3:

    # mc "What—"
    mc "什么——"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2863
translate chinese skypause3_95f5af6c:

    # eee "Careful."
    eee "小心。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2864
translate chinese skypause3_d89fb8b3:

    # eee "Every step is a little surrender."
    eee "每一步都是一次屈服。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2867
translate chinese skypause3_ea79d563:

    # eee "Sit here... and the past stops following you. Whatever you were before doesn't get up again."
    eee "坐在这里之后……过去就不会再跟随你了。你曾经的模样会永远消失。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2893
translate chinese skypause3_6225666a:

    # mc "*exhales*"
    mc "*叹气*"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2897
translate chinese skypause3_46d49479:

    # mar "You good, boss?"
    mar "你还好吧，老板？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2898
translate chinese skypause3_897df192:

    # mc "Mark."
    mc "马克。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2902
translate chinese skypause3_f176777c:

    # mc "Y...yeah. I'm fine."
    mc "我……嗯。我没事。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2903
translate chinese skypause3_7bed4efb:

    # mar "Sure about that? Looked like you were about to cave that sink in."
    mar "真的吗？我看你都快把洗脸池给压塌了。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2904
translate chinese skypause3_f1d07ef4:

    # mc "Tempting. But pipes cost more than I make in a week."
    mc "是挺想的。不过换一个的钱比我一星期工资还高。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2907
translate chinese skypause3_aed04d9e:

    # mar "Especially with us patching roofs for two shelters and a halfway house."
    mar "更别提我们还得给两个收容所和一个社区矫正中心修屋顶了。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2908
translate chinese skypause3_4119a278:

    # mc "How's that circus going?"
    mc "那倒霉地方的情况怎么样了？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2909
translate chinese skypause3_7f46f6c5:

    # mar "Same as always—slow, broke, and now apparently housing half the city's cats."
    mar "一如既往——进度慢得很，穷得叮当响，现在还快成了城里所有猫咪的家了。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2910
translate chinese skypause3_75617b20:

    # mc "Cats?"
    mc "猫？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2913
translate chinese skypause3_1bd99d6d:

    # mar "Yeah. Kids keep sneaking them in. One of them even named his after you. Calls it \"Felis [mc]us\"."
    mar "是啊。小孩们一直偷偷带猫进来。有一个甚至还给他的猫取了你的名字。叫“[mc!t]大帝”。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2914
translate chinese skypause3_c4086d6a:

    # mc "*chuckles* Great. Didn't know I was a hit with the under-twelve crowd."
    mc "*笑* 挺好。都不知道我在小孩心里那么受欢迎。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2915
translate chinese skypause3_fea0aa9c:

    # mar "Feels less like a shelter, more like a petting zoo."
    mar "感觉那里不像是收容所，更像是宠物中心了。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2916
translate chinese skypause3_ef43df9a:

    # mc "Still beats what we used to run."
    mc "照样比以前的样子要好。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2917
translate chinese skypause3_0a143173:

    # mar "Can't argue with that."
    mar "这倒是没错。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2920
translate chinese skypause3_f82e03b0:

    # mar "Oh, food drive next weekend. We're bleeding volunteers again."
    mar "噢，下周要搞食物募捐。我们又缺志愿者了。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2921
translate chinese skypause3_e72814be:

    # mc "Put me down."
    mc "我去吧。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2922
translate chinese skypause3_f5f02313:

    # mar "You sure? Last time you nearly keeled over hauling rice bags."
    mar "确定吗？上次你搬米的时候就差点累趴下。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2923
translate chinese skypause3_67c6ec68:

    # mc "*laughs* I need something to keep me busy."
    mc "*大笑* 我得找点事做，不能闲着。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2926
translate chinese skypause3_0bfa60c9:

    # mar "Or you could just sleep. I'll dig up extra hands."
    mar "你多睡会也行。我会凑够人手的。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2927
translate chinese skypause3_4a48472f:

    # mc "Fair enough. My plate's full the next few weeks anyway."
    mc "也好。本来我下周的行程就是满的。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2928
translate chinese skypause3_ea694aeb:

    # mar "I'll cover you, boss."
    mar "放心交给我吧，老板。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2932
translate chinese skypause3_1e0377dc:

    # mar "And, boss?"
    mar "还有，老板。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2933
translate chinese skypause3_582359ea:

    # mc "Hm?"
    mc "嗯？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2934
translate chinese skypause3_2db3da5f:

    # mar "Try sleeping normal hours for once."
    mar "尽量在正常时间睡觉吧，哪怕一次呢。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2935
translate chinese skypause3_abd9640b:

    # mc "Define \"normal.\""
    mc "什么叫“正常”？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2936
translate chinese skypause3_f1c6c7fc:

    # mar "The kind where you don't stare down your own reflection like it's some kind of monster."
    mar "只要能让你不再像看怪物一样看自己的倒影就算正常。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2943
translate chinese skypause3_f9aa7a18:

    # yt "Normal, huh...?"
    yt "正常，呵……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2950
translate chinese skypause3_cdbb22ea:

    # yt "I came here to see if Aine had handled things for me, and the first thing I did was pass out."
    yt "我来这里是想看看艾妮是不是帮我把事情都处理好了，结果一来就晕倒了。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2951
translate chinese skypause3_2b35b6fe_4:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2952
translate chinese skypause3_f34fbced:

    # yt "Or was it actually sleep?"
    yt "还是说我真的睡着了？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2955
translate chinese skypause3_2b35b6fe_5:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2959
translate chinese skypause3_c8f3906a:

    # mc "A letter? From who?"
    mc "信？谁写的？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2962
translate chinese skypause3_9f0d3e7e:

    # mc "Mark?"
    mc "马克吗？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2974
translate chinese skypause3_495aa095:

    # yt "Funny how I always instantly recognize your handwriting the second I see it."
    yt "我总是能一眼认出你的字迹，也是够怪的。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2979
translate chinese skypause3_10f6bcc5:

    # g "[mc], my love."
    g "[mc!t]，我的爱人。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2980
translate chinese skypause3_684a96ed:

    # g "I'm sorry. I swore I'd be there for your birthday, and now it's slipping out of my hands."
    g "对不起。我发过誓会陪你过生日，结果却要食言了。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2981
translate chinese skypause3_0d089e58:

    # g "I marked it everywhere—on my phone, on the calendar, even scrawled it on my hand like a kid. And still... here I am, failing you."
    g "我到处提醒自己——在手机上，在日历上，甚至跟小孩子一样写在了自己手上。可是……我还是要让你失望了。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2982
translate chinese skypause3_eaecd457:

    # g "Every morning I tell myself, \"Book the flight today.\" Yet when day turns to night, the hours get stolen away by fate."
    g "每天早上我都告诉自己，“今天就买机票。” 可每天晚上，我却总为其他事忙得晕头转向。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2983
translate chinese skypause3_520b5797:

    # g "I know you'll shrug it off, say it's fine. But it isn't. Not for me."
    g "我知道你会一笑而过，说没关系。可对我来说，就是有关系。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2984
translate chinese skypause3_cfc3aa43:

    # g "I hate that a promise as small as showing up feels impossible from here."
    g "我讨厌我们之间的沉默。我讨厌这个连去见你都做不到的地方。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2985
translate chinese skypause3_f1a0944f:

    # g "I wanted to see your face when you catch me in the crowd. To bring the cake myself, even if I sing off-key and you laugh at me for it."
    g "我想看到你在人群中认出我时，脸上的表情。我想亲自给你送蛋糕，哪怕我唱歌跑调被你笑也好。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2986
translate chinese skypause3_bf2878e4:

    # g "I wanted to be there in the room—not on a screen, not in a letter."
    g "我想跟你在一个房间里——而不是出现在屏幕里或者信纸上。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2987
translate chinese skypause3_7cf6f55c:

    # g "Please don't take my absence as forgetting. You've never slipped my mind, not even for a moment."
    g "请不要因为我没有去，就觉得我忘了你。你一直都在我的心上。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2988
translate chinese skypause3_9c6812a4:

    # g "When I can, I'll come back. And once I do, I'll make up for every day I wasn't at your side."
    g "我一有机会，就立马回去。我回去之后，会补偿我不在你身边的每一天。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2989
translate chinese skypause3_e5bbbd8b:

    # g "—Your Gwen."
    g "——爱你的格温。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2991
translate chinese skypause3_e7a0b602:

    # g "Hey, [mc]."
    g "嘿，[mc!t]。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2992
translate chinese skypause3_ade48063:

    # g "I owe you an apology."
    g "我得跟你道个歉。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2993
translate chinese skypause3_7b76d038:

    # g "Your birthday's right around the corner, and I swore I'd be there."
    g "你马上就要过生日了，我也保证过会陪你过。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2994
translate chinese skypause3_5412578b:

    # g "I plastered the date everywhere—on my phone, on the fridge, even on scraps of paper."
    g "我把日期弄得到处都是——存在手机里，贴在冰箱上，甚至写到了各种纸上。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2995
translate chinese skypause3_6ff81247:

    # g "I wanted to bang on your door and give you hell for getting older without me."
    g "我想一脚踹开你的门，好好惩罚你居然不在我身边就变老了。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2996
translate chinese skypause3_f2e91695:

    # g "But it's not happening this time. Work's chewing me up, and the pile never stops growing."
    g "但这次不行了。我工作太忙，各种各样的事情一个接一个。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2997
translate chinese skypause3_0d16a3bf:

    # g "Every morning I think, \"Book the flight today.\" But when day becomes night, I've already run out of hours."
    g "每天早上我都想着，“今天就买机票。” 可一到晚上，却总是抽不开身。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2998
translate chinese skypause3_619efa78:

    # g "I know you'll wave it off, but it doesn't sit right with me."
    g "我知道你不会太在意，但我心里过意不去。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:2999
translate chinese skypause3_cbb850bf:

    # g "On your day, I should be there. Not in a message. Not in an excuse."
    g "在你的生日那天，我应该在你身边的。而不是发条消息，或是找个借口。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3000
translate chinese skypause3_f1d786fb:

    # g "I wanted to show up with the cake in my hands and laugh when you groan about the singing."
    g "我想亲手拿着蛋糕到场，在你唱歌的时候大笑。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3001
translate chinese skypause3_be53c102:

    # g "Don't mistake this for me forgetting—you've been on my mind more than ever."
    g "不要以为我忘了你——我经常会想着你。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3002
translate chinese skypause3_7ad8f451:

    # g "I can't promise when, but once I do get there, it won't just be to drop in—it'll be to stay awhile."
    g "我没法保证具体什么时候，可我回去之后，不会只是稍作停留——我会多待一段时间。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3003
translate chinese skypause3_36aae142:

    # g "Happy birthday, [mc]. Even from here, I'm with you."
    g "生日快乐，[mc!t]。即使身在远方，我也陪着你。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3004
translate chinese skypause3_67a78b41:

    # g "—Gwen."
    g "——格温。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3008
translate chinese skypause3_2b35b6fe_6:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3012
translate chinese skypause3_6db25fa9:

    # g "Guess who."
    g "猜猜谁回来了。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3013
translate chinese skypause3_1e21ca7d:

    # mc "As if asking will make me forget how beautiful that voice is."
    mc "我永远不可能忘掉这么美的声音。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3020
translate chinese skypause3_f0dfff0a:

    # g "Surprise."
    g "惊不惊喜？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3032
translate chinese gwencumback_9f478f14:

    # mc "You have no idea how damn happy I am to see you right now."
    mc "你根本想象不到我现在看到你之后有多高兴。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3035
translate chinese gwencumback_c3e052b7:

    # g "That much, huh?"
    g "这么开心啊？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3038
translate chinese gwencumback_69c25b65:

    # mc "Yeah..."
    mc "是啊……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3039
translate chinese gwencumback_1bad31c0:

    # g "You okay?"
    g "你没事吧？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3040
translate chinese gwencumback_4ee1b051:

    # mc "... I'm okay. Just tired. Let me hang on a little longer..."
    mc "……我没事。就是很累。让我再多抱一会儿……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3043
translate chinese gwencumback_7b8fbd68:

    # g "Hng! Come here."
    g "多久都可以。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3046
translate chinese gwencumback_cdda8194:

    # g "I don't remember you being this heavy. What've you been eating these past nine months?"
    g "我可不记得你有这么重。这九个月你都吃什么了？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3051
translate chinese gwencumback_f8ec48ae:

    # mc "When I'm not home? Mostly takeout. Whatever's quick: burgers, pizza, noodles... the kind of junk you'd nag me for."
    mc "我不在家的时候，基本都吃外卖。汉堡，披萨，泡面……什么快吃什么。都是那种你根本不让我碰的垃圾食品。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3052
translate chinese gwencumback_7c2d5cce:

    # mc "You used to drag me out for real food. Now it's just me."
    mc "你以前总是带我去吃真正的好东西。现在就我一个人了。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3053
translate chinese gwencumback_159e3458:

    # mc "Guess I packed on weight 'cause I've been eating my sorrows... missing you across the table."
    mc "我变重大概是因为我总是借吃消愁……想念以往餐桌对面的你。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3054
translate chinese gwencumback_35b4dc07:

    # g "Must've gone heavy on the pizza, because that was cheesy as hell."
    g "你变胖肯定是因为油的吃多了，因为刚刚那句话实在太油腻了。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3055
translate chinese gwencumback_ec3bd8f4:

    # g "But this is a side of you I'll never get tired of."
    g "不过你的这一点我也永远不会腻。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3056
translate chinese gwencumback_213527d5:

    # mc "Truth is, I've been starving for something that tastes like you."
    mc "说实话，我特别怀念你的味道，都要饿坏了。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3057
translate chinese gwencumback_eff09bec:

    # g "*laughs* Oh, so now you're doubling down?"
    g "*大笑* 你还来劲了？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3058
translate chinese gwencumback_f5ce5ad4:

    # mc "Of course. Stuffed crust and all the toppings."
    mc "当然。不仅卷边要加料，还要加上所有配料。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3061
translate chinese gwencumback_94fec5c5:

    # g "Well, I'm back now. I'll take you out as much as you like."
    g "好啦，我已经回来了。之后每天都带你出去吃也可以。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3062
translate chinese gwencumback_cb70afb1:

    # mc "So..."
    mc "嗯……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3063
translate chinese gwencumback_941f4a36:

    # mc "Those two months you went quiet..."
    mc "你两个月都没有理我……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3064
translate chinese gwencumback_6817c1da:

    # mc "I kept wondering if I was saying too much. Or not enough."
    mc "我一直在想是不是我说太多了。或者说得不够多。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3065
translate chinese gwencumback_1a279091:

    # g "*laughs softly* You were perfect."
    g "*轻笑* 你做得非常完美。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3066
translate chinese gwencumback_5245eddf:

    # g "I read every message. Every dumb joke. Every late-night check-in."
    g "每条消息，每个蠢笑话，每个深夜的关心，我都会看。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3067
translate chinese gwencumback_3f38c1fe:

    # g "Sometimes I'd reread them just to hear your voice in my head."
    g "有时候我会看很多次，只为了在脑海里听听你的声音。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3068
translate chinese gwencumback_8ba7e11f:

    # mc "Then why stay silent?"
    mc "那为什么不回复呢？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3069
translate chinese gwencumback_ec938762:

    # g "Because if I answered even once, I knew I'd crack."
    g "因为我知道，只要我回复哪怕一次，就会撑不下去。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3070
translate chinese gwencumback_4ee6c631:

    # g "And I wanted this \"walking back into your life, seeing your face\" to land."
    g "而且我还要实行这个“华丽回归”的计划。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3071
translate chinese gwencumback_110e7243:

    # mc "That's... some dangerous self-control."
    mc "你的自控力……真是高到吓人。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3072
translate chinese gwencumback_5f6f2264:

    # g "I know."
    g "我知道。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3073
translate chinese gwencumback_5a9e5f73:

    # g "But it worked, didn't it?"
    g "但最终有了回报，对不对？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3074
translate chinese gwencumback_cf1adef2:

    # mc "Yeah."
    mc "是啊。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3075
translate chinese gwencumback_ca90bf87:

    # mc "It really did."
    mc "的确很有效果。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3076
translate chinese gwencumback_a31b01b1:

    # g "Are you mad at me?"
    g "你生我的气吗？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3077
translate chinese gwencumback_27320961:

    # mc "A little."
    mc "有一点。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3078
translate chinese gwencumback_bcbbec92:

    # mc "Mostly just relieved you're real again."
    mc "更多还是感到安心。因为你不再是虚无缥缈的了。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3079
translate chinese gwencumback_b68e97dc:

    # g "Hey..."
    g "嗯……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3080
translate chinese gwencumback_36ad130f:

    # g "I'm proud of you, [mc]."
    g "你是我的骄傲，[mc!t]。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3081
translate chinese gwencumback_2b35b6fe:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3082
translate chinese gwencumback_40950f4f:

    # g "Mm. Don't you dare start crying."
    g "不行。你不准哭。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3083
translate chinese gwencumback_742c8716:

    # mc "I'm not."
    mc "我没有哭。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3084
translate chinese gwencumback_9d3a1463:

    # g "*chuckles* Almost a year later and you're still a big baby."
    g "*轻笑* 过了快一年，你还是个小孩子。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3085
translate chinese gwencumback_62969607:

    # mc "But I'm {i}your{/i} big baby, Gwen Wilson."
    mc "但我是{i}你的{/i}小孩子，格温·威尔森。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3086
translate chinese gwencumback_fe7f8da5:

    # g "Mhm."
    g "嗯。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3087
translate chinese gwencumback_741c96f4:

    # g "And don't you ever forget that, baby."
    g "永远不要忘记这一点，宝贝。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3091
translate chinese gwencumback_f8ec48ae_1:

    # mc "When I'm not home? Mostly takeout. Whatever's quick: burgers, pizza, noodles... the kind of junk you'd nag me for."
    mc "我不在家的时候，基本都吃外卖。汉堡，披萨，泡面……什么快吃什么。都是那种你根本不让我碰的垃圾食品。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3092
translate chinese gwencumback_7c2d5cce_1:

    # mc "You used to drag me out for real food. Now it's just me."
    mc "你以前总是带我去吃真正的好东西。现在就我一个人了。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3093
translate chinese gwencumback_94fec5c5_1:

    # g "Well, I'm back now. I'll take you out as much as you like."
    g "好啦，我已经回来了。之后每天都带你出去吃也可以。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3094
translate chinese gwencumback_cb70afb1_1:

    # mc "So..."
    mc "嗯……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3095
translate chinese gwencumback_941f4a36_1:

    # mc "Those two months you went quiet..."
    mc "你两个月都没有理我……"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3096
translate chinese gwencumback_6817c1da_1:

    # mc "I kept wondering if I was saying too much. Or not enough."
    mc "我一直在想是不是我说太多了。或者说得不够多。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3097
translate chinese gwencumback_1a279091_1:

    # g "*laughs softly* You were perfect."
    g "*轻笑* 你做得非常完美。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3098
translate chinese gwencumback_5245eddf_1:

    # g "I read every message. Every dumb joke. Every late-night check-in."
    g "每条消息，每个蠢笑话，每个深夜的关心，我都会看。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3099
translate chinese gwencumback_3f38c1fe_1:

    # g "Sometimes I'd reread them just to hear your voice in my head."
    g "有时候我会看很多次，只为了在脑海里听听你的声音。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3100
translate chinese gwencumback_8ba7e11f_1:

    # mc "Then why stay silent?"
    mc "那为什么不回复呢？"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3101
translate chinese gwencumback_ec938762_1:

    # g "Because if I answered even once, I knew I'd crack."
    g "因为我知道，只要我回复哪怕一次，就会撑不下去。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3102
translate chinese gwencumback_4ee6c631_1:

    # g "And I wanted this \"walking back into your life, seeing your face\" to land."
    g "而且我还要实行这个“华丽回归”的计划。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3103
