translate chinese gwencumback_19bfe32b_1:

    # g "Mm-hm. And you know Klara—patience isn't exactly her strong suit. She wants everything done ASAP."
    g "嗯哼。而且你也了解克拉拉——她不算是有耐心的。总是想让一切都尽快办好。"

# game/ch2ep1.rpy:3801
translate chinese gwencumback_5cf1faeb_1:

